1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Your gas pedal feels heavy, or slow
to bounce back when you let off?

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:09,000
Not dramatic — just... sluggish.
Like it's fighting you a little.

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:15,000
One clue: buildup on the throttle body
can make the pedal feel stiff — a cheap fix.

4
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:21,000
But a pedal that sticks — not just feels
heavy — can point to a cable or sensor problem.

5
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:26,000
Don't guess which one you've got.
That's not something to wait on.

6
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Worth checking either way.
Stop by and we'll take a look.

7
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:33,000
Nick's Tire & Auto — 17625 Euclid Ave, Cleveland
